     ddttrraaccee__iioo — a DTrace provider for tracing events related to disk I/O

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     iioo::::::ssttaarrtt(_s_t_r_u_c_t _b_i_o _*, _s_t_r_u_c_t _d_e_v_s_t_a_t _*);

